      "mergeID": "6356c9fa5ca0dc4509a6bb71",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The instances list for worlds does not refresh/update after the initial load of a world's instances list. Closing and reopening the menu and selecting a world to view will not refresh this list, and none of the instance stats update either. The game must be restarted to force a refresh.\n\nThis hurts the discoverability of public instances and the activity of public hopping.\n\nAttached are 2 screenshots of the instance list to The Black Cat taken about 5 minutes apart, and in different worlds. As can be observed, none of the instances have been updated/replaced.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1247] World instances list does not refresh/update",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "631ecd871744d244ce619e64",
