      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Between 2017~2018 and part of 2019 … it use to update quickly..\n\nTill some kind of server update or changes…\n\nGradually over time it got slower\n\nEver since the quest party joined….the servers had a few hiccups and was then made another update… to what we see today if not worst\n\nIt’s most likely due to population count back then wasn’t so high…\n\nBut with so many peeps forking into VRC+ .. and other company deals or investments towards VRC ….. what reason should the server not update fast as it use to?\n\nKeeping empty instance seems problematic and can potentially cause a server overload if a group decides to BOT spam create empty instances…\n\nImagine an instance with 1000 over 40 in one instance… possible\n\nOr 1000 spammed instnace",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
