      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d100f3eb716313272a55e89|full_name}: The server continues to update the instances quite frequently, actually better than it used to since they did quite a few substantial architectural changes to their servers. Their servers can currently handle the current player count just fine.\n\nThe problem is that the VRChat client's new menu is not receiving these updates properly. Ever since the new main menu was implemented it stopped refreshing instance info after it was initially loaded, requiring the user to restart the game in order to get new instance information.\n\nInstance info can be seen updating just fine from the VRChat website, or any 3rd party application that reads from the api.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
